# bitmap.rs (P1, vspec::word): the slab bitmap and `live`. Two claimers run
# under RC11 only: under IMM and ARMv8, GenMC 0.20 stops on an internal
# check (`it != allocInfoMap_.end()`, in `ExecutionState::getAllocAccess`).
# Under ARMv8, GenMC 0.20 does not report bitmap_relaxed_release's race (the
# run passes), so that run is left out, and the ARMv8 run of
# bitmap_release_then_reserve checks its assertions only.
